  "body": "On MacOS, using one of the new binaries, lensfun doesn't load camera and lens profiles.\r\nThe reason seems to be that the path to the lensfun DB written in the `options` file is relative:\r\n\r\n```\r\n[Lensfun]\r\nDBDirectory=../Contents/Resources/lensfun\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf I change this line in my user `options` to `DBDirectory=/Applications/ART.app/Contents/Resources/lensfun` then the database is found by ART and profiles are applied as it should be.",
